00:57:22.010 --> 00:57:38.540
<v Ira Glass>Our website, ThisAmericanLife.org. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, I have to remind him sometimes that I am really, actually in charge of the radio show. His response is always the same.

00:57:38.540 --> 00:57:42.220
<v Chris Ray Gun>(SINGING) The patriarchy is raging.

00:57:42.220 --> 00:57:47.220
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
